{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"rstudio rstudio","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","fileName":"RStudio.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"RStudio","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 18:44\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Statistical Computing Workflows]] · [[R Programming Environment]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Statistical Computing Workflows","R Programming Environment","RStudio","R Console","R Help System","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"rstudio rstudio","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","fileName":"RStudio.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"RStudio","heading":"RStudio","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"RStudio is an integrated development environment for R that combines source editing, execution, debugging, project tools, and application-building support. It runs R rather than replacing the R language or its package ecosystem.\n\nThe extra interface is valuable for development tasks such as deploying interactive applications, but a basic R interface may be sufficient for a focused, hypothesis-driven analysis. The choice should follow the workflow's needs rather than be treated as a statistical difference.\n\nIn the book's working layout, [[RStudio]] brings the source editor, [[R Console]], environment, files, plots, packages, and [[R Help System]] into coordinated panes. That arrangement supports an iterative path from inspection to reusable script without making console history the authoritative analysis.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Statistical Computing Workflows","R Programming Environment","RStudio","R Console","R Help System","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"rstudio rstudio","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/RStudio.md","fileName":"RStudio.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"RStudio","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf]]\n\n[[essentialsofdatascience.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Statistical Computing Workflows","R Programming Environment","RStudio","R Console","R Help System","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}